  "why": "Four technicians in eleven jobs stopped on the same step and each said, in their own words, that they did not know how clean is clean enough. That is not a hard job \u2014 it is a sentence in the procedure that does not say what it wants, and it is the case a paper checklist can never surface because paper has nowhere to put the objection.",
